chunks.details:
Your draft is saved as you go, so a refresh, a crash, or another device picks up where you left off. The server binds to a single Tailscale 100.x address when available, otherwise 127.0.0.1, and uses an unguessable URL for each presentation.

```vega-lite
{
  "$schema": "https://vega.github.io/schema/vega-lite/v5.json",
  "data": { "values": [
    { "signal": "notes", "count": 2 },
    { "signal": "decisions", "count": 1 },
    { "signal": "comments", "count": 3 }
  ] },
  "mark": "bar",
  "encoding": {
    "x": { "field": "signal", "type": "nominal" },
    "y": { "field": "count", "type": "quantitative" }
  }
}
```
